message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mlflow-explainable"
abstract: >-
  mlflow-explainable logs a trained model and its SHAP explainer to MLflow as
  one self-contained pyfunc artifact with two methods, predict and
  shap_explain, so a serving runtime can explain any model without knowing
  which framework produced it.
